{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach, take and check it in order. Otherwise, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
    "BT": {
